      "type": "goal",
      "kind": null,
      "title": "Plan a feature",
      "body": "Question-driven plan for a new feature. Answer why/who/what before how/where;\ngive every question 2-4 options with pros and cons, choose with a rationale,\nand mark product calls pending instead of guessing.",
      "status": "active",
      "parent": null,
